      {
        "id": "evelyn-special_attack-binding_sunder_first_form",
        "name": "Binding Sunder - First Form (Special Attack)",
        "description": "After entering /bBinding Seal//b, press or hold [SPECIAL] to activate:\n\nCentered on the target affected by /bBinding Seal//b, tether surrounding enemies and detonate an explosion, dealing Fire DMG. /bBinding Seal//b will end after detonation. Dodge enemy attacks upon activating the skill, and if a /bPerfect Dodge//b is triggered, gain an additional 25% /bBurning Embers//b.\n\nAfter tethering surrounding enemies, press [BASIC] to cancel detonation and immediately follow up with the /bBasic Attack//b's 3rd hit. Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.",
        "skillType": "special",
        "statBase": "atk",
